Subject: [PATCH] Settings: Add a pure black switch to Display

Turns Settings.Secure.pure_black_theme on and off, right under Dark
theme. SystemUI then paints the dark theme's backgrounds black.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QY97AsgNLyAwQpzrsxC9zt
